  "id": "multicultural-education",
  "term": "multicultural education",
  "definition": "Multicultural education is an approach to education that reforms teaching and school structures so learners can participate fully while encountering and valuing cultural diversity. It emphasizes respect for and acceptance of different cultures, intercultural competence, and greater equity across the educational process.",
